penang: emulate, do not rewrite, the PAC instructions of libobjc-trampolines.dylib: the sealed volume hashes it in 16 KiB compressed chunks and a rewritten resident 4 KiB page made the next neighbour page-in fail (u27-cs1).

--- a/osfmk/vm/vm_fault.c
+++ b/osfmk/vm/vm_fault.c
@@ -9599,6 +9599,46 @@
  * means the page is either valid or we don't have the
  * information to say it's corrupt.
